# Dark Whelpling from the black whelps of Dustwallow Marsh and the Badlands.
# Sources: items.json (Searing / Scalding Whelp, 0.11% per kill, pfQuest);
# Forever client 1.60.1.70338 (the client's name; pfQuest: Tiny Black
# Whelpling).

step Black whelps
  tip The Searing Whelps of the Wyrmbog in southern Dustwallow Marsh (level 42) and the Scalding Whelps of eastern Badlands (level 41) drop it about once in 900 kills in our data. The waypoint is the Wyrmbog; the Badlands whelps are the same grind.
  collect 10822 "Dark Whelpling" @46.9,72.5 -- The Wyrmbog
